# Feed Focus for YouTube
#
# API keys are NO LONGER configured here. The published extension is
# "bring your own key": each user pastes their own API key into the popup,
# which stores it in chrome.storage.local and reads it at request time.
# Nothing is bundled into the shipped extension.
#
# Get a DashScope key (for Qwen models): https://bailian.console.aliyun.com/?apiKey=1
# Get an Ark key (for Doubao / ep-… models): https://www.volcengine.com/product/ark
#
# This file is kept only as documentation; the build does not read it.
